        {
          "text": "Izaza dawantu etiyili, hiyakwikala namuchima wawu wumu, nayitoŋojoka yawu yimu, hikwadiŋi niwumu wehli nindi yuma yahetayi yindi kanka winduku; ilaŋa yuma yawu yejima hiyikwikala yebomba. ",
          "type": "text",
