              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apostolu hiyakushimuna naŋovu yayeni wunsahu wawu wakusaŋuka kwasaŋukiliyi Mwanta Yesu mudi afu. Luwi lwalweni hilukuwanina wejima wawu; lwakwila kwosi muntu niwumu wabulili chumaku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.33",
